[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Escape]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:09.76]Why did the prisoner attack the driver? | 为什么战俘袭击了司机？
[00:14.72]When he had killed the guard, the prisoner of war quickly dragged him into the bushes. | 那个战俘杀死卫兵后，迅速把他拖进了灌木丛。
[00:22.17]Working rapidly in the darkness, he soon changed into the dead man's clothes. | 他在黑暗中麻利地干着，很快换上了死者的衣服。
[00:29.11]Now, dressed in a blue uniform and with a rifle over his shoulder, | 现在，他身穿蓝色制服，肩扛步枪，
[00:35.61]the prisoner marched boldly up and down in front of the camp. | 大模大样地在营地门前走来走去。
[00:40.97]He could hear shouting in the camp itself. | 他能听到营房里的叫喊声。
[00:44.53]Lights were blazing and men were running here and there: they had just discovered that a prisoner had escaped. | 灯光通明，人们东奔西跑：他们刚刚发现有个战俘逃跑了。
[00:54.19]At that moment, a large black car with four officers inside it, stopped at the camp gates. | 正在此时，一辆坐着4个军官的黑色大轿车停在了营门口。
[01:03.80]The officers got out and the prisoner stood to attention and saluted as they passed. | 军官们下了车，战俘立正站好，在他们经过时敬了礼。
[01:11.43]When they had gone the driver of the car came towards him. | 他们走后，汽车司机朝他走来。
[01:16.65]The man obviously wanted to talk. | 这个人显然是想聊天。
[01:20.28]He was rather elderly with grey hair and clear blue eyes. | 他上了年纪，灰白的头发，蓝眼睛炯炯有神。
[01:25.90]The prisoner felt sorry for him, but there was nothing else he could do. | 战俘为他感到惋惜，但他也别无办法。
[01:32.48]As the man came near the prisoner knocked him to the ground with a sharp blow. | 当这个人走近时，战俘一拳把他打倒在地。
[01:39.66]Then, jumping into the car, he drove off as quickly as he could. | 然后跳上汽车，以最快的速度把车开走了。
